Weekly roundup of Aptos ecosystem happening

Binance has enabled Soft Staking support for Aptos

@DecibelTrade Testnet is livebuilt by Decibel Foundation & @AptosLabs on the high-speed rails of Aptos.

Safeheron has integrated full support for the Aptos network and its new Fungible Asset (FA) standard

@Panoraexchange  adopted the @Chainlink interoperability standard on Aptos

@PaxosLabs (backed by @Paxos), announced that a bridged version of USDG is coming to Aptos via @LayerZero_Core as USDG0.

Lamboo now supports @Aptos Connect and all major Aptos wallets

